  "id": "osf-review-lens-schema",
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-06T13:59:32.014Z",
  "title": "Per-lens review answer schema",
  "summary": "The review answer schema sent to a reviewer is no longer the static compiled-in document: `answer::schema_for(lens)` clones the base schema and rewrites `properties.scores` so it requires exactly one 0–1 number per criterion of the lens being run. `reviewers::run_with_retry` builds that schema once per lens and threads it through `run_child` into `build_args`, so both the `--schema` file and the inline `--json-schema` value now carry the lens-specific document. Tests assert the generated schema obeys the structured-output keyword rules for every shipped lens, and a real codex answer fixture is validated against it.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
